(text "05 / RAIL DEBUG AND SINGLE POWER LED" (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "9ee96bb8-ef54-5e6e-a7a7-6412b673273d"))
(text "J8 KEYED 2x10 DEBUG ONLY - NOT EURORACK POWER. No onboard MCU / no blink. D10 is ordinary +5V power indication.\n3.3 V external controller: inputs Hi-Z, outputs OPEN-DRAIN ONLY; no external pullups/power into AUX.\nNormal operation is hardware PG/window only; qualification JP1 stays OPEN. See docs/debug-interface.md for all pins and sequencing." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "37fad0a1-c9f4-5a1d-a2e2-f783fa9cee61"))
(text "J8 pin1 GND / rectangular pad / red stripe. KEYED20-pin DEBUG ONLY.\nAUX_MON OUTPUT via10k, not controller power. No external pullups.\nADC3/5/6/7/8/9 = +12/-12/+5/MID/VBUS/VPROT;17..20 NC." (at 20.32 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "fdc4358c-c5a8-52e0-8d5b-dc2624157ce9"))
(text "ONE ordinary RED3mm power LED.\nFinal P5 -> R32 1k -> D10 -> GND.\nNo blink or external LED controller.\nDoes NOT indicate all rails healthy." (at 243.84 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "25681fe6-41bd-51ea-93e1-c29a702b6d7e"))
(text "Debug cable is OPTIONAL; not in the power-enable path.\nNormal operation: hardware PG + UV/OV and RUN closed.\nJP1 stays OPEN only as explicit prototype qualification inhibit." (at 20.32 271.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "0b4d49ea-dc4f-5041-90ee-36c508597d9f"))
